sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Commenter
    participant API as API (api-prd)
    participant DB as MongoDB
    participant S as Socket service
    participant O as Another user, same ECS task

    C->>API: POST /api/comment/add
    API->>DB: save comment
    API->>DB: load and populate every member
    DB-->>API: all member documents
    Note over C,API: the only part the commenter actually waits on
    API-->>C: 200 OK
    Note over API,S: detached, fires as one burst, nothing awaits it
    API->>S: about 12,800 gRPC emits (members x 2 hosts)
    Note over API,S: keeps running about 8s after the response
    O->>API: unrelated request, same ECS task
    API-->>O: p95 250ms to 10.05s
